<title>FY STORE - Digital Top Up Provider & Gaming Hub</title>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{background:#0a0a0a!important;color:#fff!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center}
  .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px;background:#0a0a0a}
